{"page":189,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:14","surah":9,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"قَـٰتِلُوهُمْ يُعَذِّبْهُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِأَيْدِيكُمْ وَيُخْزِهِمْ وَيَنصُرْكُمْ عَلَيْهِمْ وَيَشْفِ صُدُورَ قَوْمٍ مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Fight them: God will punish them at your hands, He will disgrace them, He will help you to conquer them, He will heal the believers’ feelings","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَـٰتِلُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"Fight them ","transliteration":"qātilūhum","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُعَذِّبْهُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah will punish them","transliteration":"yuʿadhib'humu","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will punish them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَيْدِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"by your hands","transliteration":"bi-aydīkum","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُخْزِهِمْ","en_gloss":"and disgrace them","transliteration":"wayukh'zihim","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَنصُرْكُمْ","en_gloss":"and give you victory","transliteration":"wayanṣur'kum","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَشْفِ","en_gloss":"and will heal","transliteration":"wayashfi","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"صُدُورَ","en_gloss":"(the) breasts","transliteration":"ṣudūra","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) a people","transliteration":"qawmin","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"(who are) believers","transliteration":"mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:14"}]},{"verse_key":"9:15","surah":9,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَيُذْهِبْ غَيْظَ قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ وَيَتُوبُ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and remove the rage from their hearts. God turns to whoever He will in His mercy; God is all knowing and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيُذْهِبْ","en_gloss":"And remove","transliteration":"wayudh'hib","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"غَيْظَ","en_gloss":"(the) anger","transliteration":"ghayẓa","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَيَتُوبُ","en_gloss":"And Allah accepts repentance","transliteration":"wayatūbu","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah accepts repentance","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَكِيمٌ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"9:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:15"}]},{"verse_key":"9:16","surah":9,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ حَسِبْتُمْ أَن تُتْرَكُوا۟ وَلَمَّا يَعْلَمِ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ جَـٰهَدُوا۟ مِنكُمْ وَلَمْ يَتَّخِذُوا۟ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ وَلَا رَسُولِهِۦ وَلَا ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَلِيجَةً ۚ وَٱللَّهُ خَبِيرٌۢ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you think that you will be left untested without God identifying which of you will strive for His cause and take no supporters apart from God, His Messenger, and other believers? God is fully aware of all your actions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"9:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَسِبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"(do) you think","transliteration":"ḥasib'tum","verse_key":"9:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُتْرَكُوا۟","en_gloss":"you would be left","transliteration":"tut'