":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:16"}]},{"verse_key":"9:17","surah":9,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"مَا كَانَ لِلْمُشْرِكِينَ أَن يَعْمُرُوا۟ مَسَـٰجِدَ ٱللَّهِ شَـٰهِدِينَ عَلَىٰٓ أَنفُسِهِم بِٱلْكُفْرِ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ حَبِطَتْ أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ وَفِى ٱلنَّارِ هُمْ خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is not right for the idolaters to tend God’s places of worship while testifying to their own disbelief: the deeds of such people will come to nothing and they will abide in Hell.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(It) is not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(It) is not","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"for the polytheists","transliteration":"lil'mush'rikīna","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَعْمُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they maintain","transliteration":"yaʿmurū","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَسَـٰجِدَ","en_gloss":"(the) masajid of Allah","transliteration":"masājida","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the) masajid of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَـٰهِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(while) witnessing","transliteration":"shāhidīna","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِم","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusihim","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِٱلْكُفْرِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[with] disbelief","transliteration":"bil-kuf'ri","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"(For) those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَبِطَتْ","en_gloss":"worthless","transliteration":"ḥabiṭat","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(are) their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmāluhum","verse_key":"9:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"and in","trans